# Routing 🛤️

```python
@app.route('/user/<username>')
def user_profile(username):
    return f'User: {username}'

@app.route('/post', methods=['GET', 'POST'])
def post():
    if request.method == 'POST':
        data = request.form['data']
        return f'Posted: {data}'
    return 'Form page'

@app.route('/api/data')
def api():
    return jsonify({'status': 'ok'})
```
